{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8240fc9ec9466aa7b2118302c69183c66f21531683436eb24d694a27a4e15fac","ja":"やり切ったからこそ","zh":"正因全力以赴","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e","ja":"一時間後……","zh":"一小时后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"23771c4b49b710bc6295f700116aa17c92090614751a4c7aec50cf1bd692effb","ja":"そして、ラストはアメージングでホラーな\nアナザーワールドへゴーするのです！","zh":"然后，在最后前往惊人又恐怖的\n另一个世界吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"28fefa60cc2f55bce407cfe773fd1c04c7604ea401e2bc95a5e3b99367aaa7d2","ja":"あははっ！　全然違うジャンルになっちゃったね！\nでも、そういうのも面白そうかも！","zh":"啊哈哈！完全变成不一样的类型了呢！\n不过，那样好像也挺有意思的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3f99d082297f3254ef1ca5834ce6dc383a0b888a40329067fbefec00feecf49d","ja":"王道なハッピーエンドも、\n奇想天外な結末も、どっちもいいな～……。","zh":"经典的圆满结局也好，\n意想不到的结局也罢，感觉都很不错啊～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"fb7b6ee97928c596988c17be00e0f2ad07fac35123d42136c10002d7a19017fc","ja":"ロコちゃんの言う通り、答え合わせが楽しみ。\n……でもやっぱり、終わっちゃうのは寂しいな。","zh":"就像ROCO说的那样，好期待对答案。\n……不过果然，要结束了还是会觉得有点寂寞呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1990ea6dfa673c84515c30a9006df2bb4e431775a54f3f2c772f895181b86dc8","ja":"それでも読んだ後は、ハッピーな気持ちの方が\n大きいですよ。ロコはそう思います！","zh":"即便如此，读完之后还是开心的心情\n更多哦。ROCO是这么觉得的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f74ac7147ace7af0f7be1314f116a8aea9f948a842eae449b6bc7971cbca0558","ja":"ロコも、フェイバリットな作品は、\nずっと作り続けていたくなることがあります。","zh":"ROCO有时也会很想一直做\n自己特别喜欢的作品呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"687c1cb27da109e0414edc405763801fca00904b0b7a6d111dee668d9b7b52e8","ja":"でも、コンプリートするからこそ、\n達成感を感じることができますから！","zh":"但是，正因为全部收集齐了，\n才能体会到成就感呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b4788b8e2d51585000252a9a3443634c773eb20f6a91313632c73156c017c4bc","ja":"……！\nそっか、そうだよね。わかるよ、その気持ち！","zh":"……！\n是吗，也是呢。我懂的，那种心情！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"26a51fcf8cf4cd97adf9f8b4ab4bb4922454d8b6bba0124a8fbadfc49c0ddb0e","ja":"『STARDOM ROAD』の千秋楽のときも、\n私、そんな気持ちになってたから。","zh":"《STARDOM ROAD》千秋乐的时候，\n我也是那样的心情。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"648195317bce5e8696d223b4f3774a91937bacafb101311acf336fb208752883","ja":"もう終わっちゃうんだって気持ちもあったけど……\nそれ以上に、みんなと走り切れたのがうれしくて！","zh":"虽然心里也有些觉得“这就结束了吗……”\n但比起这个，能和大家一起坚持跑完全程更让我感到开心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8825dbfbf16e3dd6eaf6ee9bedcbd8a48ae4c2780391a9fcd1f290f0dc99d904","ja":"やり切って終わるときって、\n寂しさよりも達成感のほうが、ずっと大きいよね！","zh":"全力以赴地迎来结束时，\n成就感会远胜过寂寞呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f3ecf8494d44fdbfe31ffb182e3c0f169683be2009eb553b63741c565e121bcc","ja":"はい♪　だからきっとストーリーのラストも、\nユリコにハッピーを届けてくれるはずです！","zh":"好的♪　所以故事的结局，\n也一定会给百合子带来幸福的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1539.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7dc5a60f1f31822f00fc77c45e7752a50e3d3dff0bceb9c616c2488d4bdae8f8","ja":"ありがとう、ロコちゃん♪\nふふ、最終巻、はやく読みたいな……！","zh":"谢谢你，ROCO♪\n呵呵，好想快点读到最终卷啊……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
